    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d311-a25">

                <pb facs="0692" n="608" xml:id="pg608"/>

                <p rendition="#center">[Seal: Republic of Mexico, office of the secretary of war and
                    navy, 1st Sec, No. 17085.]</p>
                <p>The President of the Republic has learned the contents of your communication of
                    the 17th instant, in which you copy that of the political chief of the Canton
                    Galeana, regarding the attack made by the hostile Indians on the 13th on the
                    mining district of Sabinal, and the measures ordered to be taken in the
                    premises.</p>
                <p>Liberty and constitution.</p>
                <closer>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-left"><placeName>Mexico</placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1885-10-24">October 24,
                        1885</date>.</dateline>
                    <lb/>
                    <signed>Y. REYUELTAS,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">P. O. D.
                    S.</hi></signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p><hi rendition="#italic">To the governor of the State of Chihuahua.</hi></p>
                </postscript>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
